# Trailer hook answer (persistent)

This file was written by `/crav1-finalize-commit` when you answered **Strip tool trailers on every commit for this repo?**

Answer: ANSWER

- `yes`: `.githooks/commit-msg` strips the known tool trailers (Cursor, Claude Code, Anthropic) on every commit. Each person turns it on once with `git config core.hooksPath .githooks`; finalize-commit runs that line for anyone whose config is missing. Human `Co-authored-by` lines stay.
- `no`: finalize-commit does not ask again.

